{
  "id": "chapter-01",
  "title": "第一幕 遗忘之海",
  "initialState": {
    "background":"assets/bg/01.png",
    "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm/chapter-01.mp3",
    "flags": {}
  },
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "showCharacter",
      "characterId": "rin",
      "sprite": "smile",
      "position": "right",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "type": "showCharacter",
      "characterId": "umi",
      "sprite": "soft",
      "position": "left",
      "transition": "slide"
    },
    {
      "type": "if",
      "key": "trustedUmi",
      "equals": true,
      "then": "trustedOpening",
      "else": "neutralOpening"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "trustedOpening",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "你果然跟过来了。既然刚才你选了相信我，那这一幕我就不再绕弯子。",
      "voice": "assets/audio/我等了很久.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "bgm",
      "track": "assets/audio/bgm/chapter-01-tension.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "jump",
      "target": "sharedMiddle"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "neutralOpening",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "你还是来了。虽然我们刚才还不算熟，但至少故事已经顺利切到新的场景。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/umi/chapter-002.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "sharedMiddle",
      "speaker": "rin",
      "text": "从现在开始，你只需要继续新增 scene 文件、填 events、替换素材路径，就能把整部游戏往后扩。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/rin/chapter-001.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "rin",
      "text": "如果某一幕结束后还要进下一幕，就给当前 scene 顶层加 nextSceneId。要中途切幕，也可以用 changeScene 事件。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/rin/chapter-002.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "end"
    }
  ]
}
